{"kind":"notes","id":"nt/lfowzg","slide":6,"text":"This is an important differentiator. When a document describes a new kind of operational fact, the system can propose a bounded schema and its required checks. People approve it. Every extension is reversible and auditable.\n\n[Sources]\nCapability Lab design and example: Synchus project team. Demo data: demo/02_cold_chain_readings.csv."}
